    "children": [
      {
        "id": "p28-q5-a",
        "type": "part",
        "label": "a",
        "prompt": "Find the polynomial $P(x)$ of degree 4 for which $P(1)=1$, $P(2)=2$, $P(3)=3$, $P(4)=4$ and $P(5)=12$.",
        "layout": "list",
        "columns": null,
        "questionDiagrams": [],
        "children": [],
        "answer": {
          "short": "$P(x)=\\frac{7}{24}(x-1)(x-2)(x-3)(x-4)+x$.\n\nLet $Q(x)=P(x)-x$; its roots are $1,2,3,4$.",
          "worked": "Let $Q(x)=P(x)-x$. Since $P$ has degree 4, so does $Q$.\n\n$$\\begin{align*}Q(1)&=1-1=0\\\\Q(2)&=2-2=0\\\\Q(3)&=3-3=0\\\\Q(4)&=4-4=0\\\\Q(5)&=12-5=7.\\end{align*}$$\n\nBy the Factor Theorem,\n$$Q(x)=a(x-1)(x-2)(x-3)(x-4).$$\nUsing $Q(5)=7$,\n$$\\begin{align*}a(5-1)(5-2)(5-3)(5-4)&=7\\\\24a&=7\\\\a&=\\frac{7}{24}.\\end{align*}$$\nTherefore,\n$$\\begin{align*}P(x)&=Q(x)+x\\\\P(x)&=\\frac{7}{24}(x-1)(x-2)(x-3)(x-4)+x.\\end{align*}$$",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
        "answerSpaceMm": 58
      },
      {
        "id": "p28-q5-b",
        "type": "part",
        "label": "b",
        "prompt": "Show that there is no polynomial $P(x)$ of degree 4 for which $P(1)=1$, $P(2)=2$, $P(3)=3$, $P(4)=4$ and $P(5)=5$.",
        "layout": "list",
        "columns": null,
        "questionDiagrams": [],
        "children": [],
        "answer": {
          "short": "No such degree-4 polynomial exists.\n\n$Q(x)=P(x)-x$ would have degree 4 and five distinct roots, contradicting the root bound.",
          "worked": "Suppose such a polynomial exists and let $Q(x)=P(x)-x$. Subtracting $x$ leaves its degree equal to 4.\n\n$$\\begin{align*}Q(1)&=P(1)-1=0\\\\Q(2)&=P(2)-2=0\\\\Q(3)&=P(3)-3=0\\\\Q(4)&=P(4)-4=0\\\\Q(5)&=P(5)-5=0.\\end{align*}$$\n\nThus $Q$ has five distinct roots. By the Factor Theorem it has the five linear factors $(x-1)$, $(x-2)$, $(x-3)$, $(x-4)$ and $(x-5)$, so its degree would be at least 5. This contradicts its degree being 4. Therefore no such polynomial exists.",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
        "answerSpaceMm": 38
      }
    ]
  },
